      "costUsd": 0.007533000000000001,
      "pronunciationText": "The third check is an online tool, a computer algebra system that does exact algebra and calculus. Type in the integral from one to three of one over x, and it returns log three. Many tools write log for the natural log. Ask for the indefinite integral, and you might get log x, with no mod signs and no plus C. So read the answer, then write it the course way: the natural log of mod x, plus C. A tool is a check on your working, not a replacement for showing it."
