      "costUsd": 0.0059900000000000005,
      "pronunciationText": "Test x squared sine x. Swap in minus x, and you get minus x squared sine x, so it's odd, and it gives zero from minus pi to pi. Three is even, so it gives twice the integral from zero to pi of three, which is two times three pi. The answer is six pi. Zero is wrong. Only the odd part cancels, and the three stays."
